
ILLG_ENDMACRO		:.ENDMACRO must be preceded by macro definition
ILLG_LOCAL		:.LOCAL valid only in macro definitions
DOT_MACRO		:MACRO must be preceded by '.'
DOT_INCLUDE		:INCLUDE must be preceded by '.'
EXPCT_ID		:expecting an identifer at symbol '%s'
EXPCT_RP		:expecting ')' at symbol '%s'
EXPCT_PH		:expecting a place holder at symbol '%s'
EXPCT_ENDMACRO		:expecting .ENDMACRO at symbol '%s'
EXPCT_EQ		:expecting '=' at symbol '%s'
EXPCT_INT		:expecting an integer at symbol '%s'
EXPCT_FILENAME		:expecting a filename at symbol '%s'
EXPCT_SEMICOLON		:expecting an ';' at symbol '%s'
REDEF			:trying to redefine %s
PH_OUTRANGE		:place holder out of range at symbol '%s'
TOOFEW_ARGS		:not enough arguments to macro
TOOMANY_ARGS		:too many arguments to macro
EXPCT_MACROARG		:expecting a macro argument at symbol '%s'
